{"title": "Trump claims Russia-Ukraine energy ceasefire amid continued strikes", "summary": "U.S. President Donald Trump announced an \"energy ceasefire\" between Russia and Ukraine on October 11, 2026. However, Ukraine reported ongoing Russian strikes on energy sites, including a power plant in Kharkiv, shortly after Trump's statement. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy stated that Kyiv is ready to agree to an energy ceasefire, but warned that Russia must do the same. The EU's foreign policy chief, Kaja Kallas, said the bloc would welcome such a truce \"when it holds.\"", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "ट्रम्प का दावा, रूस-यूक्रेन में ऊर्जा युद्धविराम, लेकिन हमले जारी", "summary_hi": "अमेरिकी राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प ने 11 अक्टूबर, 2026 को रूस और यूक्रेन के बीच \"ऊर्जा युद्धविराम\" की घोषणा की। हालांकि, ट्रम्प के बयान के तुरंत बाद यूक्रेन ने खार्किव में एक बिजली संयंत्र सहित ऊर्जा स्थलों पर रूसी हमलों की सूचना दी। यूक्रेनी राष्ट्रपति वोलोडिमिर ज़ेलेंस्की ने कहा कि कीव ऊर्जा युद्धविराम के लिए सहमत होने को तैयार है, लेकिन चेतावनी दी कि रूस को भी ऐसा ही करना होगा। यूरोपीय संघ के विदेश नीति प्रमुख, काजा कल्लास ने कहा कि यह गुट ऐसे युद्धविराम का \"जब यह टिका रहेगा\" तब स्वागत करेगा।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized Trump's announcement of an \"energy ceasefire\" between Russia and Ukraine."], "center": ["Highlighted the positive impact of the Russia-Ukraine energy truce on global market sentiment, leading to eased Eurozone bond yields."], "right": ["Stressed that despite Trump's announcement of an \"energy ceasefire,\" Kyiv reported continued attacks."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["रूस और यूक्रेन के बीच \"ऊर्जा युद्धविराम\" की ट्रम्प की घोषणा पर जोर दिया।"], "center": ["रूस-यूक्रेन ऊर्जा युद्धविराम के वैश्विक बाजार की भावना पर सकारात्मक प्रभाव को उजागर किया, जिससे यूरोजोन बॉन्ड यील्ड में कमी आई।"], "right": ["इस बात पर जोर दिया कि \"ऊर्जा युद्धविराम\" की ट्रम्प की घोषणा के बावजूद, कीव ने हमलों के जारी रहने की सूचना दी।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/86r6po/article71574195.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/%20trump%20russia%20ukraine%20ceasefire.png", "sources": [{"source": "Associated Press", "owner": "Associated Press", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQX2lxSmVfVW1FQ005MEQ1RjN1MTJ0SWRPRG96RWhFUmQzT3BJdF9sZXRQVlJ5UjU4dE9TSG1BaWZSRnVJdXhCZVY3RmgwdnQzV1JnLTFTYnlQSUMyd0FTZGxiSkQ4V0ZQLTZvMmdBNUxtQmRZeTF1VmNaLUMtUU9yX1NFa29nQ2hhRE9GVG0ydzU1S2t4NjJiZWw2Qm9RaFE5R0Y0?oc=5", "headline": "Zelenskyy comments on proposed energy truce"}, {"source": "Deutsche Welle", "owner": "Deutsche Welle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQQUM1UWxtVndLYWZGRTVxVUV5QVc5czhJYkFTX21uUF9jZzRXMU0tQjdzMDJZSkNsTlA2MW9taTdkWXl2cHVRbFIxeHBhZHEwQXpRVlRyYzVZRk5Kb0JxcnBkNHR3dFUwVk9NejRxOVlZU3VSbEVyS25RZTNMQUJEOGtoRnFZMzNOQkdDMEZMVTVYWDA?oc=5", "headline": "Germany rejects Trump demand, 'fully supports' Zelenskyy"}, {"source": "Daily Mirror", "owner": "Daily Mirror", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Wes Streeting says UK has role to play after Donald Trump's astonishing Zelensky attack"}, {"source": "Sky News", "owner": "Sky News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPTkN0UVB5ZlZ4NFNhZVBBTXIyaVVfX19GYUlSX09LTjFDT3lCM0taVFFQRnp1RnRZM0dOTnhObkNsYmVhcFJxSGF2UVBCQlZkSWFNSHN2b0tYQXhfM3Q2aUx0NzB0YlB5TEd6Z0h0OEJwV1ZCUUE1RVpYWUs2M3JFblY4T0cza0o1WV9tM1BfRkl3QnlzNmpkVXp3MHJqS2xvMnJzeE50ajFjUGRyNUVkdkxCYzJ2T1NXUkE?oc=5", "headline": "Trump blames Zelenskyy not Iran war for rise in fuel costs"}, {"source": "Euronews", "owner": "Euronews", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNb1lGTnRKQlpESFlES2ZQVnliMUdiZVZ5Q2ZCcjVxdExZbzlySlg3djdaOTdUNzFOa2dMNE5VSDhvSVVSYmpPVmMwd3R0Rlg5SWZnenE